Test Data

SELECT J.CTRY_CODE, J.OUT_DATE_STARTED, J.OUT_DATE_ENDED, P.IS_PARTNER
FROM ptp_enc.TAX_JRDT J
JOIN ctsg_enc.V_CTRY_PARTNER P ON J.CTRY_CODE = P.CTRY_CODE
WHERE J.OUT_DATE_ENDED < SYSDATE;

Expected Result

Returned jurisdiction(s) have OUT_DATE_ENDED earlier than the Reporting Fiscal Year start date,
and IS_PARTNER = 'N', so they are excluded from the extraction scope.
